    {
      "id": "claim_651b9d94de33485e99bbed159f4499c6",
      "statement": "`docs migrate` converts MkDocs-formatted files to Mintlify format and supports `.md`, `.markdown`, and `.ipynb` files; it can process single files, entire directories recursively, and accepts `--dry-run` (preview to stdout) and `--output` (specify destination) options.",
