      "id": "claim_16ba6db4306d4fa1ac369bce1c62e97f",
      "statement": "When `docs migrate` converts files in place (no `--output` specified), `.ipynb` files are converted to `.md` (original `.ipynb` deleted after successful conversion), while `.md` and `.markdown` files retain their original extension; `--output` allows customizing the output location.",
