      "id": "claim_9b4ef03fc4dc4451b64a37f1b29aa333",
      "statement": "`docs migrate` processes each file by: reading content, parsing markdown using `to_mint()` from `pipeline.tools.parser`, removing `.md` suffixes from links via `drop_suffix_from_links()`, and either printing to stdout (dry-run) or writing to the output path after creating directories.",
