      "id": "claim_c7dacff07fed4813b9207d4b729052d6",
      "statement": "`docs mv <old_path> <new_path>` moves a file and automatically rewrites all cross-references in the documentation tree: it scans all `.md`, `.markdown`, `.mdx`, and `.ipynb` files, updates links pointing to the old path to the new path, adjusts internal links within the moved file for its new parent directory, and supports `--dry-run` to preview changes.",
